#passage(("The thing is, how do we know? How do we know what Ramadan is? Can you prove what's today? Today's Saturday. Can you prove that it's Saturday? You gotta bring me the first Saturday and the first group of people that said today is Saturday. And it applies to Ramadan. People just knew what Ramadan was because they're there. Now, by the way, [Nasi'] is a very complicated issue, because there's three different, maybe even more different, opinions as to what [Nasi'] is. One position is it's flipping around the months. The other position is adding an extra month. This applies to salah.",), "Farid Responds, “I had to delete my last video. [Quran-only]”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dA-hJ-ucpSA", ((775, "12:55–15:01"),), id: 2025)
