// U ML120:518-563 | The Muslim Lantern | 4
#passage(("Many people have this issue today. There's many people who say: Just follow the Quran alone. Why? It's easier. But it's easier to be a lazy person. Meaning that if I have an issue with this, I reject it: \"The Hadith doesn't make sense to me, I'm going to reject all of it.\" OK, but how are you going to pray? \"No, I'm going to take the part that I like, which is how to pray, how to fast.\" OK, but is it authentic? Is it not authentic? Is it reliable or not? Is it historically accurate or not?", "So, it's easier, especially in this day and age. People just go to AI: How can I do this? That's it! Nobody even wants to read a book anymore. Nobody wants to ask a person of knowledge anymore. So, a lot of people can take that route.", "Also there's another route: maybe there's a Narration that's very popular that people misuse against Islam. \"OK, I don't want to be defensive with that, I reject this, this is not authentic!\" No, the religion is not a game, it's not our game. It's not my backyard where I take what I want and put what I want. This is God's Revelation. And since it's God's revelation, there's no doubt that every single thing He taught is wise and has an answer. There's no doubt to that.", "I've been doing live streams for years. I cannot possibly know what you're going to bring, it's impossible. But in the end, I know that whatever it is, because Islam is a PERFECT religion, it will have a response. I know that! And we've been demonstrating that, not just me, but other brothers, for years.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Romanian Christian Grills Muslim With Difficult Questions! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RCeSQlWHPxI", ((1470, "24:30–24:56"), (1501, "25:01–25:14"), (1516, "25:16–25:41"), (1544, "25:44–26:00"),), id: 2034)
