#passage(("Everything I just mentioned to you is not even 5% of the Science of Hadith and the amount of scrutiny that goes into the Narrations, and the different branches of the definitions of Hadith. What is a Hadith مرفوع (Marfoo')? And what is a Hadith الموقوف (Mawqoof)? And when is a Hadith considered problematic? What types of hidden defects are there? I didn't even go to, let's even say, 1% of the whole understanding of the Science of Hadith. This small information I gave you now, if it's not enough for you to understand that there is no doubt that the Hadith is historically reliable — all of the evidences that I've given already showing you why the Hadith is a necessity, and why your point of view that you've taken is completely inconsistent and illogical — then no one can guide you except Allahﷻ.", "I want to say something very basic: Do you really think, as a Muslim, that Allahﷻ is going to allow 99.9% of Muslims to be misguided? And He is only going to give the Truth and Guidance to you and your group of Hadith rejectors? Do you, as a rational individual, have not enough trust of Allahﷻ? You believe that He will allow the overwhelming majority of Muslims today to be misguided? And to follow a Hadith that is being fabricated? That none of it is actually attributed to the Prophetﷺ? And all of it is lies, and Allah has allowed all of these lies to be spread down? And for all of these overwhelming majority of Muslims to follow misguidance? Does that really make any rational sense?!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “A Complete Annihilation Of Hadith Rejector's Methodology! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Gc0mbEqasg", ((3705, "1:01:45–1:02:32"), (3769, "1:02:49–1:03:26"),), id: 2048)
