#passage(("Multiple attestation is different than [tawatur]. [Mutawatir] is a hadith in which the number of narratives is so high. It wouldn't matter if it was narrated by yahood, by Christians, by Buddhists; it wouldn't matter. That's the whole idea, as long as it's impossible for them to be lying. If there are too many people, that it's impossible for it to be a lie, then we have to believe that this thing occurred. That's the basic thing.",), "Farid Responds, “Full Debate: Farid (Sunni) vs Bayat (Shia)”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iwc31dHLfco", ((174, "2:54–6:35"),), id: 2064)
