#refbox("Reference text: sunnah.com, Sahih Muslim 650a", (("", "Ibn Umar reported Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) assaying:"), ("", "Prayer said in a congregation is twenty-seven degrees more excellent than prayer said by a single person."),))
