#passage(("You said reliable people can make mistakes. I agree, reliable people can make mistakes. If you have multiple people narrating something, then you can use these corroborations, and you will come up with reports that have the same [ma'na].",), "Farid Responds, “Debate: Farid vs MuhammadFromGod - Reliability of Hadith System”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q3H7g7bsz3M", ((2895, "48:15–48:53"),), id: 2085)
