#passage(("Apus is trying to make it seem like I'm telling people to go drink camel urine, which is something I never did. I'm talking about a specific hadith, and in that specific hadith it's speaking about a group of people that go to the prophet, peace be upon him, and he tells them to drink camel urine for that specific issue, for a specific disease, and they actually do get better. I shared examples from modern articles written by medical professionals that show that camel urine has some health benefits, and they are beneficial in combating some dangerous diseases.",), "Farid Responds, “Apus Challenged me to drink Camel Urine”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RVVwo0yesxw", ((34, "0:34–1:51"),), id: 2150)
