#passage(("This Hadith is actually a [sahih] Hadith. [Ibn Majah] didn't grade this; you'd know that if you were competent enough to check the original Source. I'm not sure who recorded it as weak. [Ibn Majah] is not considered as strong as [Bukhari], I agree, but it is considered one of the authentic Sunni collections. Referring to as one of the six authentic collections seems to have led Samir to assume that [Ibn Majah] only quotes what he deems to be authentic, which is another misconception.", "So why even bring up this Hadith as weak anyways? Why are you even mention this? Because it causes problems? Well, Samir, I'm only going out of my way to mention this because folks like yourself are looking for Gog and Magog on Google Maps, assuming they'd find a wall. There is no reason to assume that a wall still exists unless you believe in reports like the previous one, that explicitly states that it will only collapse at the end.",), "Farid Responds, “Abdullah Sameer: Alexander is Dhu Al-Qarnayn”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=taW1dn5Bn0k", ((120, "2:00–2:45"), (175, "2:55–3:25"),), id: 2178)
