#passage(("One of the dumbest arguments I've ever come across against the Hadith is that the authors of the six books are Persians. It's a conspiracy by the Persians. They're fabricating a Hadith and tricking us poor Arabs and Muslims in general into following this fake narrative. This argument is so dumb. First of all, because it's not even accurate. The authors of the six books aren't all Persians. Abu Dawud is an Arab. That's number one. Secondly, there are many books out there that are Hadith books that do not fall under the six books. Musnad Ahmad is, I think, as large as all six books combined. Ahmad was not a Persian. There's a difference of opinion about al-Bukhari and Muslim as to whether they're Persians or not. Al-Bukhari is a Ju'fi. Muslim is a Qushayri. Were they Mawali or were they Arabs? I'm actually leaning towards them being Persians, but there's a difference of opinion.", "Most importantly, if you speak to Hadith rejectors, they will reject Hadith that don't fit into their values. And most of these folks aren't racist. Most of these folks hate racism. If they even find a hint of anything racist in a Hadith, whether it's an authentic Hadith, whether it's a fabricated Hadith, they will claim that this is a fabrication: no way this is true because this feels like it's racist. However, they will be racist in order to reject a Hadith, and they will say stuff like the compilers of a Hadith are Persians. Subhanallah. They are guilty of that which they hate most.", "They say crazy stuff like Al-Bukhari was a Persian that didn't know Arabic. Subhanallah. I wasn't aware that Sahih al-Bukhari was originally written in Uzbeki and was only translated into Arabic recently. Khalq Af'al al-'Ibad, you should check it out. It's quite well written, again in Arabic. If you go back, I don't even believe there's a classical Persian manuscript for al-Bukhari. I could be mistaken, but al-Bukhari knew Arabic better than most Arabs today. It's pathetic arguments by folks who are desperate.",), "Farid Responds, “\"Persian Conspiracy Against Islam!\"”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5TP2Y31oauo", ((4, "0:04–1:05"), (66, "1:06–1:59"), (124, "2:04–2:54"),), id: 2185)
