#passage(("I was listening to one of my favorite channels, the EF Dawah Channel, and they had a stream, and one particular individual caught my attention because he claimed that he's a published author, and he's writing a book about al-Bukhari, who he believes is a satanic person that's trying to destroy Islam. And when I heard this, I had to confront him, because he was using a hadith in order to criticize al-Bukhari that no one has ever used before. It's not in Bukhari. You want to claim that al-Bukhari is satanic or whatever, the first thing you got to do is you got to bring hadiths from al-Bukhari. When you actually go to the Hadith you find out that it's not in Sahih al-Bukhari, but it's narrated by Abu Dawud and other authors.",), "Farid Responds, “Confronting Author on \"The Satanic Bukhari\" Book!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0TwjlL4ui_o", ((4, "0:04–2:38"),), id: 2192)
